{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788994374677,"sessionID":"ses_f77a0a10bffeFUJZZsTQ59ZTrI","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_0122sPVN7ePJjcFspvtm4dtb","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Volumes/Personal/Users/davidwilliams/.ringer/audition-2026-09-09-round3/copilot-haiku45 && for case in cases/c*/*/in.bs; do echo \"=== $case ===\"; cat \"$case\"; echo; done"},"output":"=== cases/c01-exhaustive-closed/Verdict/in.bs ===\nmodule Verdict\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :lost    => :unknown\n}\n\n=== cases/c02-catchall-open/Open/in.bs ===\nmodule Open\npublic atom Describe(atom s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    _        => :unknown\n}\n\n=== cases/c03-inexhaustive/Missing/in.bs ===\nmodule Missing\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\n\n=== cases/c04-unreachable/Shadowed/in.bs ===\nmodule Shadowed\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :placed  => :again\n}\n\n=== cases/c05-tuple-exhaustive/Decide/in.bs ===\nmodule Decide\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent, bool redelivered)\nRoute(o, p, r) -> (o, p, r) switch {\n    (true,  _,     _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true,  _)     => :dead_letter,\n    (false, false, false) => :requeue,\n    (false, false, true)  => :requeue\n}\n\n=== cases/c06-tuple-inexhaustive/Partial/in.bs ===\nmodule Partial\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent)\nRoute(o, p) -> (o, p) switch {\n    (true,  _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true)  => :dead_letter\n}\n\n=== cases/c07-guarded/Retry/in.bs ===\nmodule Retry\npublic atom Classify(int n)\nClassify(n) -> n switch {\n    n when n < 5 => :retried,\n    >= 5         => :exhausted\n}\n\n=== cases/c08-wrong-return/Wrong/in.bs ===\nmodule Wrong\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic int Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => 1,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\n\n=== cases/c09-arg-not-accepted/Calls/in.bs ===\nmodule Calls\npublic bool Big(int n)\nBig(n) -> n > 100\n\npublic atom Tag(atom a)\nTag(a) -> :seen\n\npublic atom Check(int n)\nCheck(n) -> n switch {\n    m when Big(m) => Tag(m),\n    _             => :small\n}\n\n=== cases/c10-switch-in-guard/Guarded/in.bs ===\nmodule Guarded\npublic atom F(atom x)\n\nF(x) when x switch { :a => true, _ => false } -> :yes\nF(x) -> :no\n\n=== cases/c11-unbound-variable/Scopes/in.bs ===\nmodule Scopes\npublic term Bad(term e)\n\nBad(e) -> e switch {\n    (:ok, v) => w,\n    (:no, w) => w\n}\n\n=== cases/c12-vacuous-arm/Scored/in.bs ===\nmodule Scored\ntype Verdict = :pass | :fail\n\npublic int Score(Verdict v)\n\nScore(v) -> v switch {\n    (:pass, n) => n,\n    :pass      => 1,\n    :fail      => 0\n}\n\n=== cases/c13-unsatisfiable-guard/Graded/in.bs ===\nmodule Graded\npublic int Grade(int n)\n\nGrade(n) -> n switch {\n    x when x > 5 and x < 3 => 0,\n    x                      => 1\n}\n\n","metadata":{"output":"=== cases/c01-exhaustive-closed/Verdict/in.bs ===\nmodule Verdict\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :lost    => :unknown\n}\n\n=== cases/c02-catchall-open/Open/in.bs ===\nmodule Open\npublic atom Describe(atom s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    _        => :unknown\n}\n\n=== cases/c03-inexhaustive/Missing/in.bs ===\nmodule Missing\ntype State = :placed | :shipped | :lost\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\n\n=== cases/c04-unreachable/Shadowed/in.bs ===\nmodule Shadowed\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic atom Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => :new,\n    :shipped => :gone,\n    :placed  => :again\n}\n\n=== cases/c05-tuple-exhaustive/Decide/in.bs ===\nmodule Decide\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent, bool redelivered)\nRoute(o, p, r) -> (o, p, r) switch {\n    (true,  _,     _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true,  _)     => :dead_letter,\n    (false, false, false) => :requeue,\n    (false, false, true)  => :requeue\n}\n\n=== cases/c06-tuple-inexhaustive/Partial/in.bs ===\nmodule Partial\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent)\nRoute(o, p) -> (o, p) switch {\n    (true,  _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true)  => :dead_letter\n}\n\n=== cases/c07-guarded/Retry/in.bs ===\nmodule Retry\npublic atom Classify(int n)\nClassify(n) -> n switch {\n    n when n < 5 => :retried,\n    >= 5         => :exhausted\n}\n\n=== cases/c08-wrong-return/Wrong/in.bs ===\nmodule Wrong\ntype State = :placed | :shipped\npublic int Describe(State s)\nDescribe(s) -> s switch {\n    :placed  => 1,\n    :shipped => :gone\n}\n\n=== cases/c09-arg-not-accepted/Calls/in.bs ===\nmodule Calls\npublic bool Big(int n)\nBig(n) -> n > 100\n\npublic atom Tag(atom a)\nTag(a) -> :seen\n\npublic atom Check(int n)\nCheck(n) -> n switch {\n    m when Big(m) => Tag(m),\n    _             => :small\n}\n\n=== cases/c10-switch-in-guard/Guarded/in.bs ===\nmodule Guarded\npublic atom F(atom x)\n\nF(x) when x switch { :a => true, _ => false } -> :yes\nF(x) -> :no\n\n=== cases/c11-unbound-variable/Scopes/in.bs ===\nmodule Scopes\npublic term Bad(term e)\n\nBad(e) -> e switch {\n    (:ok, v) => w,\n    (:no, w) => w\n}\n\n=== cases/c12-vacuous-arm/Scored/in.bs ===\nmodule Scored\ntype Verdict = :pass | :fail\n\npublic int Score(Verdict v)\n\nScore(v) -> v switch {\n    (:pass, n) => n,\n    :pass      => 1,\n    :fail      => 0\n}\n\n=== cases/c13-unsatisfiable-guard/Graded/in.bs ===\nmodule Graded\npublic int Grade(int n)\n\nGrade(n) -> n switch {\n    x when x > 5 and x < 3 => 0,\n    x                      => 1\n}\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /Volumes/Personal/Users/davidwilliams/.ringer/audition-2026-09-09-round3/copilot-haiku45 && for case in cases/c*/*/in.bs; do echo \"=== $case ===\"; cat \"$case\"; echo; done","time":{"start":1788994374657,"end":1788994374659}},"metadata":{"anthropic":{"caller":{"type":"direct"}}},"id":"prt_0885fc9b60012Dkam8f24lJF2V","sessionID":"ses_f77a0a10bffeFUJZZsTQ59ZTrI","messageID":"msg_0885fc413001nf2aEPYx4Jd8Sa"}}
