{"type":"text","timestamp":1788994680562,"sessionID":"ses_f77a0a10bffeFUJZZsTQ59ZTrI","part":{"id":"prt_088646058001bkqomImH6Ts4Ea","messageID":"msg_088645b6e001rnB8a5j9vIuPaV","sessionID":"ses_f77a0a10bffeFUJZZsTQ59ZTrI","type":"text","text":"Now the issue is that there are 5 held-out cases that fail. The feedback says I \"fitted the examples rather than the specification\". Let me re-read PACKET.md very carefully to find any rules I'm missing.\n\nKey rules from PACKET.md:\n\n1. **switch_inexhaustive** - When switch doesn't cover all cases\n2. **unreachable_arm** - When an earlier arm already covers all values\n3. **vacuous_arm** - When pattern is not a member of subject's type\n4. **unsatisfiable_arm_guard** - When guard condition is impossible\n5. **rebinding** - When pattern rebinds a clause parameter\n6. **unbound_variable** - When body uses variable not bound by pattern or clause\n7. **return_not_declared** - When arm returns value not in declared return type\n8. **arg_not_accepted** - When function call has wrong argument type\n9. **switch_in_guard** - When switch appears in a guard\n\nLet me check specific rules I might be missing:\n\nFrom the spec:\n- \"A **catch-all is legal only where the residual is open**\" - I check this\n- \"A bare name in a pattern *introduces* a name\" - I check rebinding\n- \"An arm whose pattern is a bare name already in scope is rebinding\" - checking\n- For unreachable: \"An arm every earlier arm already covers is dead\" - I only check literal patterns!\n- For vacuous: includes patterns not members of the type\n- For exhaustiveness on `bool`: Need to handle bool specially\n\nLet me think about what might be wrong. Some potential issues:\n\n1. I might not be correctly identifying when a type is closed (e.g., bool should be treated as closed type with cases)\n2. I might be missing certain patterns in exhaustiveness\n3. I might not be correctly parsing guards\n4. I might not be correctly handling all pattern types\n\nLet me check if bool is properly registered as closed:","time":{"start":1788994674776,"end":1788994680555}}}
